    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div>That&#39;s interesting. I&#39;m not familiar with Shiny. If you could compile a minimal representative example from your experience, of what doesn&#39;t work and what&#39;s needed to make it work, it would be very valuable for us, and we could try to improve the integration.</div></div></div></div>"
